<div><div class="eti">Sideboard</div>
<h3>Confirm your sideboard in one click</h3>
<p>Magic Online doesn't send your sideboarded list in time, so between games a small panel asks whether you changed it: use last time's change, say there were none, or open the editor.</p></div>
