<section class="seccion" id="funciones">
<div class="envoltura">
<div class="cab-sec">
<div class="eti">Features</div>
<h2>Everything you'd note down after each match, done for you</h2>
</div>
<div class="funciones">
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 6h16M4 12h10M4 18h7"></path><circle cx="18.5" cy="16.5" r="2.5"></circle></svg>
<h3>Matches and games</h3>
<p>Each Bo3 is one row with its score (2-1, 1-2…) that opens to show every game: play or draw, result and mulligans.</p></div>
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="14" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="5"></rect><circle cx="9" cy="11" r="2"></circle><path d="m21 15-4.5-4.5L8 19"></path></svg>
<h3>Hands and screenshots</h3>
<p>Your opening hand, the hand you kept and screenshots of the key moments. Press F8 or the button over the game to save any moment you want and add a note to it. Screenshots are saved on your PC and can be turned off in Settings.</p></div>
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"></circle><path d="M12 8v4l2.5 2.5"></path></svg>
<h3>Opponent's deck</h3>
<p>It compares the opponent's cards with the most played decks of the game's format and names the closest one. The meta lists update every 3 days.</p></div>
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 20V11M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2"></path></svg>
<h3>Statistics</h3>
<p>Match and game win rates, streaks, last days, and breakdowns by mulligans, play/draw, deck and opponent archetype.</p></div>
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="16" rx="2" width="13" x="7" y="3"></rect><path d="M4 7v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h10"></path></svg>
<h3>Your decks</h3>
<p>Each list you play with its win rate. Sideboard variants are grouped under the same deck, and you can rename them. In Magic Online, a deck takes the name you saved it with when the list matches exactly; otherwise it is named by its colors.</p></div>
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M21 12a8 8 0 0 1-11.6 7.1L4 20l1-4.6A8 8 0 1 1 21 12z"></path><path d="M9 10h6M9 13.5h4"></path></svg>
<h3>AI loss review (subscribers)</h3>
<p>Subscribers get an AI analysis of every lost game: what went wrong, where you could have played better and what to try next. Subscription: 5 € per month on Ko-fi.</p>
<p style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 18px"><a href="https://ko-fi.com/eusebiog96/tiers" data-goatcounter-click="apoyo" data-goatcounter-title="kofi-funciones-en" rel="noopener" style="font-weight:600" target="_blank"><span>Subscribe on Ko-fi →</span></a></p></div>
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="12" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="4"></rect><path d="M8 20h8M12 16v4"></path><path d="M7 9h5M7 12h8"></path></svg>
<h3>Overlay while you play</h3>
<p>A separate window next to the game, in Arena or Magic Online, with your deck's remaining cards, the opponent's cards seen so far and the turn. It only shows public information or what can be worked out from what has been played. In Magic Online it can show less when the log has no table state.</p>
<p style="margin-top:10px"><a class="enlace-man" href="/overlay/">Overlay and deck tracker: what it shows →</a></p></div>
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 7h13l-3-3M20 17H7l3 3"></path></svg>
<h3>Sideboard guide</h3>
<p>Per matchup, what you brought in and took out in your own games and how it went, so you stop sideboarding from memory.</p></div>
<div class="funcion"><svg viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="9" cy="8" r="3"></circle><path d="M3 20v-1a5 5 0 0 1 5-5h2a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v1"></path><path d="M17 11a3 3 0 1 0 0-6M21 20v-1a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9"></path></svg>
<h3>Coach and team</h3>
<p>Error tags and notes on each game, matchup tables and a report for your coach. Team mode shares your games, screenshots and notes through a common folder, and your coach sees each game in full, replay included.</p></div>
</div>
