<section class="seccion" id="como-funciona">
<div class="envoltura">
<div class="cab-sec">
<div class="eti">How it works</div>
<h2>From the Arena and Magic Online logs to your history</h2>
<p>With «Detailed Logs» on, Arena writes every game to Player.log. Magic Online writes its own log, mtgo.log, with nothing to turn on. ManaLab reads them as you play and turns them into matches you can review.</p>
</div>
<div class="conversion">
<div class="log"><span class="t">Player.log (Arena)</span><pre><b>[UnityCrossThreadLogger]</b> GreToClientEvent
{ <span class="k">"type"</span>: "GREMessageType_MulliganReq",
  <span class="k">"systemSeatIds"</span>: [1] }
<b>[UnityCrossThreadLogger]</b> GreToClientEvent
{ <span class="k">"gameInfo"</span>: {
    <span class="k">"matchState"</span>: "MatchState_GameComplete",
    <span class="k">"gameNumber"</span>: 3,
    <span class="k">"results"</span>: [{ <span class="k">"result"</span>: "ResultType_WinLoss",
                 <span class="k">"winningTeamId"</span>: 1 }] } }</pre></div>
