<p><strong style="color:var(--texto)">The app is free. Only the AI analysis is paid.</strong></p>
<p>Open any lost game and ask the AI what went wrong, where you could have played better and what to try next time. It reads the game's data, not your name or the opponent's.</p>
<p>Want to try it first? Ask for a free trial by <a href="mailto:manalab.app@gmail.com">email</a>.</p>
