<h3>Free, with AI analysis by subscription</h3>
<p>ManaLab is made in spare time. The program stays free. The subscription (5 € per month on Ko-fi) pays for the AI service; donations on Ko-fi help with everything else.</p>
<p>Want to try it first? Ask for a free trial by <a href="mailto:manalab.app@gmail.com">email</a>.</p>
<div class="acciones" style="margin-top:18px"><a class="boton prim" data-goatcounter-click="apoyo" data-goatcounter-title="kofi-apoyo-en" href="https://ko-fi.com/eusebiog96" id="enlace-donar" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><span>Subscribe or donate on Ko-fi</span></a></div>
</div>
<div class="gastos">
